，如SAP等。","ClassificationOne":"天杉高科","ClassificationTwo":"(社招)专业支撑序列","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-29T15:25:55","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"c69cb634-f186-48ba-b3d3-c3280ea243a9","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310273571,"PostDateInt":1774583766000,"PostDate":"2026-03-27T11:56:06","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"风电实验工程师（测试开发）(J22913)","OrgId":700453788,"Org":"整机测试研究部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["新疆维吾尔自治区·乌鲁木齐市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"①依据国标 / 行标与项目需求，独立编制可执行测试方案。\n②负责风电叶片、齿轮箱、发电机、塔筒、传动链等结构 / 动力学测试：传感器布置、安装、标定、数据采集系统调试；振动、应变、噪声、位移、疲劳、模态等测试执行。\n③熟练使用测试系统与分析软件，完成数据处理、谱分析、故障特征提取、结果判定。\n④独立排查现场问题：信号干扰、传感器异常、工况不稳定、系统通讯故障等。\n⑤输出完整、规范、可评审的测试报告，给出结论与改进建议。\n⑥维护测试仪器、采集系统、工装夹具，保障测试环境稳定可靠。\n⑦与研发、设计、客户对接测试需求，落地测试技术应用。","Require":"①本科及以上，机械、力学、测控技术、电气、自动化、新能源等相关专业。\n②3年以上结构测试 / 振动测试 / 数据采集 / 风电试验相关工作经验。\n③精通至少一类测试系统操作（东华测试、LMS、NI、本土采集系统均可）。\n④掌握：振动、应变、模态、疲劳、动力学测试基本原理与流程。\n⑤能独立完成：测试方案编制、现场部署与调试、数据处理与报告输出、常见工程问题排查。\n⑥熟悉 Office、能使用测试分析软件（DHDAS、Test.Lab、MATLAB 等）优先。\n⑦有风电整机 / 部件测试、风场现场测试经验优先。\n⑧能接受出差，动手能力强，逻辑清晰，责任心强。是否需要修订；","ClassificationOne":"集团直属单位","ClassificationTwo":"(社招)研发序列","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-27T11:56:06","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"f9606038-0002-4908-b13a-53fddc008457","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":310273380,"PostDateInt":1773744510000,"PostDate":"2026-03-17T18:48:30","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"材料工程师(J22798)","OrgId":700181723,"Org":"国创中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·盐城市"],"Salar